What _; does in a modifier

Example modifier

modifier onlyOwner() {
  require(msg.sender == owner);
  _;
}

The caller check runs before the function body.
_; runs the body; code after it runs afterward.

The example assumes owner is defined and initialized; it is a modifier fragment, not a complete ownership contract.

